  "id": "custodial-care",
  "term": "custodial care",
  "definition": "Custodial care is a traditional mental health nursing approach centered more on looking after and maintaining patients than on active, recovery-focused therapeutic work. In this context, it is contrasted with modern nursing practice that aims to support recovery and broader quality of life.",
